'''Hearts of Darkness (Merciless)''' is one of the 7 [[Continuation Stage]]s that the player can access after beating [[An Elder Secret (Merciless)]], the only stage in [[Growing Strange]]. Completing this stage yields an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit Seed]], or at a 1% chance, an [[Catfruit|Elder Catfruit]].

