==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns.
**6 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (800%) spawns.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns.

==Strategy==
If you plan on completing this stage whenever it comes up, having [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] is a must. Other [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark units]] such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]] can also help.

Additionally, you will want something that can deal good damage, as pure crowd-control can only get you so far in this stage. For the Tackeys, you can either lure the first bunch of enemies close to the Cat Base therefore isolating them from their respective supports, and then kill Razorback as soon as possible, or you can take advantage of the stage's width to brute force your way through the entirety of Razorback's HP while tanking the Tackeys' onslaught. Either way, once Razorback is dead, you have effectively won.

