==Trivia==
*The English name of this stage could be referencing a [[wikipedia:Heart of Darkness (disambiguation)|number of different things]] of the same or similar name, the most famous being the 1899 novel ''[[wikipedia:Heart of Darkness|Heart of Darkness]]''.
*Hearts of Darkness's Japanese name, Taiko no Kuro Rensei (太古の黒連星, "Ancient Black Binary Star"), may be a reference to Kuroi Sanrensei (黒い三連星, "Black Triple Binary Stars"), the Japanese name of the [[wikia:gundam:Black Tri-Stars|Black Tri-Stars]] from ''[[wikia:gundam:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]], [[Razorback]] was buffed to 150% instead of 100%, there were a total of 11 Shadow Boxer Ks instead of 7, and the boss fight included a third [[Tackey]] that spawned 33.33 seconds after the first 2.

